			id: "4130000000000003"
			title: "Read a Compound"
			description: ["Obtain carbon dioxide and read it as a compound, not as a bag of interchangeable ingredients. Its identity includes a fixed carbon-to-oxygen relationship. This is why composition data must retain stoichiometry when Matterworks maps material chemistry."]
			x: 5.0d
			y: -1.25d
