			id: "4130000000000004"
			title: "Composition Is Not Manufacturing"
			description: ["Turn the Phase 3 HDPE process into an HDPE sheet. This is a concrete PROCESS-policy example: even if chemistry can describe the polymer feedstocks, the finished engineering material remains owned by its industrial production route. Matterworks does not allow composition knowledge to bypass that route."]
