			hide_dependency_lines: false
			id: "4130000000000005"
			title: "Nuclear Identity Preserves Provenance"
			description: ["After the fusion program is established, obtain a ChemLib uranium element sample. Compare it conceptually with NuclearCraft uranium isotopes, fuels and irradiated products: the parent element may become a generic atomic identity, but isotope, enrichment, fuel and waste states remain NuclearCraft process-owned and are never flattened into one universal material."]
			x: 10.0d
